{
  "id": "RAW_a4333ddd4a",
  "title": "3 天卖出 10 万份！不会写代码，他靠 AI 做出 Steam 爆款",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjgzMzkwMQ==&mid=2653653317&idx=1&sn=7ec5abf8ef90d18901a0aac620ea57a1",
  "date": "2026-11-17 19:44:00",
  "author": "傅盛",
  "siteName": "傅盛",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>傅盛和龙虾三万</span> <span>2026-11-17 19:44</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_d79b5e9.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>谁说AI做的游戏只能是Demo？</p>\n  <h1 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">前几天，我用AI做了一个网页版的类《王者荣耀》游戏，评论区不少人说，这只是个Demo，离真正的商业游戏还差得远。就算拿去卖，也没人愿意买。</span></span></h1>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169656\" data-ratio=\"0.256797583081571\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"662\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_a540bb6.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">巧了，最近</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">真有人靠AI做游戏，卖爆了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">！</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一个不会写代码的人，独立开发了一款游戏，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">上线3天卖出10万份</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">！</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">前48小时销售额达到35.6万美元</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，约合人民币250万元，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">最高同时在线人数达到9377人</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169653\" data-ratio=\"0.8833333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_0bff018.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">游戏叫《Slotbound》，开发者Optima Arch此前几乎</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">没有实际编程和游戏开发经验</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">3天卖出10万份</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》的玩法挺有创意，把老虎机和策略战斗结合在一起。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">玩家面前有一个3×3的老虎机，每次转动，都可能抽出不同的士兵。抽出来的士兵会加入自己的军队，自动攻击一波波涌来的敌人。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169661\" data-ratio=\"0.5625579240037072\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170324_328666c.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">你还可以通过合成、升级、装备搭配，让士兵变得越来越强。运气好，一次老虎机大奖，就可能召唤出强力角色，瞬间改变战局。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"325\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"506169658\" data-ratio=\"0.562390158172232\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1138\" style=\"width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170324_58e1253.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">游戏定价9.99美元，首发优惠8.99美元。7月推出免费Demo后，曾冲上Steam&nbsp;</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">Demo热门榜第二名</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">9月愿望单突破10万</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图像\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"419\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"506169660\" data-ratio=\"0.7251864601262191\" style=\"width:100%;\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1743\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_3d97290.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">11月13日正式上线，48小时卖出5万份，3天突破10万份。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">一款AI参与开发的游戏，已经有10万人愿意掏钱买单。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">一行代码不会写靠AI做出大爆款</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》使用的是LÖVE（Love2D）游戏框架。今年5月，开发者做出的Demo，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">代码100%由AI生成</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169654\" data-ratio=\"0.7185185185185186\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_436e6cf.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">他甚至有时候</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">连AI写的代码是什么意思都看不懂，还得让AI解释</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">代码主要靠Codex</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，就用自然语言描述想实现的功能，让AI编写程序，再逐步完成老虎机抽取、士兵召唤、自动战斗、合成升级等游戏系统。Claude和Gemini也参与辅助设计游戏系统、解决技术问题。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169663\" data-ratio=\"0.24259259259259258\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_71c995d.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">程序有了，画面怎么办？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》采用像素画风，里面有大量士兵形象、战斗动画、游戏背景和操作界面。开发者用PixelLab生成像素风素材和动画，Gemini辅助制作视觉素材，ElevenLabs负责音效，再结合现成素材包，把游戏的画面和声音也做了出来。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169662\" data-ratio=\"0.5625579240037072\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170324_0f5f3a7.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">编程、美术、动画、音效，这些原本需要不同专业技能的工作，就这样被一个人用各种AI工具串了起来。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169655\" data-ratio=\"0.8925925925925926\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_c7c2089.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">不过，这款游戏开发了将近一年，过程也没那么轻松。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">去年这个时候，AI编程能力还没有今天这么强</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。他需要自己拆解任务，告诉AI每一步要做什么，再运行程序、人工测试，发现Bug后反馈给AI修改。有些系统还得推倒重做，反复调试。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">虽然代码交给了AI，但任务拆解、测试、排查问题这些重复性工作，仍然有不少落在人身上。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 8px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169664\" data-ratio=\"0.15462962962962962\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170323_049db5a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">这也是为什么我觉得，这个案例放到今天看，反而更有冲击力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">因为现在的编程Agent已经进化了很多。</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">给它明确的目标和标准，它就能自主规划任务、编写代码、运行测试、发现问题再修改</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，形成完整的工作循环。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">前几天，我只给AI</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">一句提示词</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，让它做一个网页版的类《王者荣耀》游戏，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">AI自己连续工作了大约20小时，就把游戏做出来了</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5625579240037072\" data-w=\"1079\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170324_6e305fb.gif\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">如果今天用最新的模型重新开发《Slotbound》，我相信开发周期肯定能大幅缩短。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;\">AI正在改写游戏开发的竞争规则</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》这个案例，我觉得至少说明了三个变化。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第一，能力边界变了。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;一个不会写代码的人，已经能借助AI独立完成商业游戏开发。专业技能正在变成可以通过自然语言调用的能力。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第二，创业成本变了。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;编程、美术、动画、音效等多个环节，都有AI工具可以承担大量工作。一个人就能完成过去需要多人协作的任务，组建专业团队不再是入场的必要条件。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">第三，竞争规则变了。</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;当技术实现越来越容易，更多人有机会把创意做成产品。游戏的创意、玩法、审美和产品判断，也会变得越来越重要。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》就是一个很好的例子，AI降低了专业门槛，也让更多普通人有机会直接进入市场，参与竞争。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"3 2 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;display: inline !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 12px 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: -apple-system, \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: center;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;node&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;span&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;color: rgb(49, 49, 49);font-family: \\&quot;PingFang SC\\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, \\&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\\&quot;, \\&quot;Microsoft YaHei\\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 700;letter-spacing: 1px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\">· · ·</span></span></p>\n  <h2 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px;outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 20px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);border-left: 4px solid rgb(231, 76, 60);font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(253, 253, 253);pointer-events: initial;visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">玩家买的是游戏，不是代码</span></span></h2>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">那么回到之前评论区的质疑：AI做的游戏，到底有没有人愿意买？</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">《Slotbound》已经用10万份销量给出了答案。</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">玩家买的是游戏体验，好不好玩才是关键，谁会单纯因为代码是AI写的就不买？</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">AI正在降低开发门槛、压缩开发成本，编程能力还在飞速进化。只要有好的创意，就有机会借助AI把它做成真正好玩的游戏，甚至成为受到玩家欢迎的商业作品。</span></span></p>\n  <p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">接下来，一定会有更多原本进不了游戏行业的人，带着自己的创意直接参与竞争。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">A也许下一个爆款，比我们想象中来得更快。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: normal;\">其实不光游戏行业，AI正在改变几乎所有行业的工作方式。 这种变化才刚刚开始，大家真的应该赶快学起来、用起来。</span></span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">12月11日，我们将在深圳举办</span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">猎豹AI实战派线下课</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，从认知、管理、实操等多个维度，分享猎豹移动在AI转型中踩过的坑，以及总结出来的实战经验。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">欢迎企业一把手们带着AI转型中的真实问题来到现场，一起寻找答案。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"506169668\" data-ratio=\"1.776851851851852\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261117170324_dcdd869.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "作者分享一位几乎无编程经验的开发者如何靠 AI 工具（Codex、Gemini、PixelLab、ElevenLabs 等）串联开发出销售额 35.6 万美元、3 天破 10 万份的《Slotbound》游戏，揭示 AI 正在重塑游戏开发的竞争规则。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "作者分享一位几乎无编程经验的开发者如何靠 AI 工具（Codex、Gemini、PixelLab、ElevenLabs 等）串联开发出销售额 35.6 万美元、3 天破 10 万份的《Slotbound》游戏，揭示 AI 正在重塑游戏开发的竞争规则。",
  "summary": "文章通过《Slotbound》爆款案例，展示 AI 在游戏开发中的实际落地能力。该游戏由几乎无编程经验的 Optima Arch 开发，3 天内销售 10 万份，前 48 小时收入 35.6 万美元。开发者利用 Codex 生成 100%代码，Gemini 辅助系统设计，PixelLab 制作像素素材，ElevenLabs 处理音效，实现了从编程、美术、动画到音效的全链路 AI 辅助。虽然 AI 编程能力日益成熟，但任务拆解、测试和问题排查仍需人工参与。作者进一步指出，AI 正在改变专业技能获取门槛，降低创业成本，让更多普通创意人有机会将创意直接转化为商业产品，最终玩家购买的是游戏体验而非代码来源。",
